# mrinspect-fixture: source=b807d52 kind=logic

commit b807d52f4e1a396c8d0e5b7f2a913c6d84e0f327
Author: kitchen-bot <kitchen-bot@margherita-pizza.internal>
Date:   Sat Sep 12 10:26:33 2026 +0800

    fix(runtime): split remaining deadline across kitchen, payment, and delivery-quote calls (spurious hop timeouts)

    Order admission passed the entire remaining request deadline to the
    first downstream call, kitchen availability. When that call returned
    late in its own window, payment authorization and the delivery-quote
    call that follow received almost no time and failed with spurious
    timeouts even though the overall request deadline had not passed.
    splitDownstreamDeadlines now reserves an encoding buffer and divides
    what remains into three bounded shares before dispatch.

diff --git a/internal/runtime/deadline.go b/internal/runtime/deadline.go
